# Line endings are pinned here so they do not depend on each clone's
# core.autocrlf setting. Everything text is stored with LF in the repository
# AND checked out with LF, which is what the working tree already holds -
# `text=auto` alone would store LF but check out CRLF on Windows, and every
# `git add` then warns that it is about to rewrite the file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never normalise these, whether or not they are tracked today.
*.png binary
*.prg binary
*.iq  binary
